graph TD
    A[Histone Modification Signal] --> B{Modification Type?}
    B -->|Acetylation| C[Histone Acetyltransferase]
    B -->|Methylation| D[Histone Methyltransferase]
    B -->|Phosphorylation| E[Histone Kinase]
    B -->|Ubiquitination| F[Histone Ubiquitin Ligase]
    
    C --> G[Histone Acetylation]
    G --> H[Chromatin Opening]
    H --> I[Transcription Activation]
    
    D --> J[Histone Methylation]
    J --> K[Chromatin State]
    K --> L[Transcription Regulation]
    
    E --> M[Histone Phosphorylation]
    M --> N[Chromatin Signaling]
    N --> O[Transcription Response]
    
    F --> P[Histone Ubiquitination]
    P --> Q[Chromatin Remodeling]
    Q --> R[Transcription Control]
    
    I --> S[Histone Modification Complete]
    L --> S
    O --> S
    R --> S
    
    %% Regulation
    S --> T[Modification Status]
    T --> U{Transcription Required?}
    U -->|Yes| V[Modification Activation]
    U -->|No| W[Modification Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    X[Histone Acetyltransferases] --> C
    Y[Histone Methyltransferases] --> D
    Z[Histone Kinases] --> E
    AA[Histone Ubiquitin Ligases] --> F
    BB[Histone Deacetylases] --> S
    CC[Histone Demethylases] --> S
    DD[Histone Phosphatases] --> S
    EE[Histone Deubiquitinases] --> S
    
